# Hunter per-org budget (mandatory)

Joel would rather spend Hunter on **new orgs / opportunities** than deep-mine one contact grid (e.g. 9 Seattle Symphony Hunter rows).

## Rule

- **Top 3** Hunter-sourced contacts per organization (ranked by seniority / title).
- **≤ 3 Hunter credits** spent on find-more for that org (Domain Search + Verifier).
- When the cap is hit, refuse further Domain Search and say so — do not broaden the query to pull more people.
- Manual / pasted contacts do **not** count against the 3 Hunter slots.

Constants: `MAX_HUNTER_CONTACTS_PER_ORG`, `MAX_HUNTER_CREDITS_PER_ORG` in `lib/sales/enrichment/hunter-org-budget.ts`.
Spend tracked on `organization.importMetadata.hunterCreditsSpent`.
